# 📌 Why These Commands Matter

In Linux system administration and cybersecurity, it is crucial to understand:

- Which processes are running
- Which ports are open
- Which files have dangerous permissions
- Whether important files have been modified

The commands in this document are widely used in:
- SOC analysis
- Digital forensics
- Incident response
- Malware analysis
- System administration

