# 🔍 Process Analysis Commands

Process analysis helps identify active programs and resource usage.

---

## `ps aux`

Lists all currently running processes.

```bash
ps aux
Option Breakdown
Option
Meaning
a
Show processes for all users
u
Display user and resource usage
x
Include background processes
Example Output
Plain text
